<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 57 0 R
/T (The inventory module keeps a live count of raw materials such as fabric and hardware across every storage location, distinguishing stock that is available from stock already reserved against open work orders. When a build is configured or a work order is created, the system automatically checks and reserves the required materials, preventing two jobs from being promised the same limited stock. Low-stock and reorder-point alerts surface automatically as material runs low.)
/E (The inventory module keeps a live count of raw materials such as fabric and hardware across every storage location, distinguishing stock that is available from stock already reserved against open work orders. When a build is configured or a work order is created, the system automatically checks and reserves the required materials, preventing two jobs from being promised the same limited stock. Low-stock and reorder-point alerts surface automatically as material runs low.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
